# .git-blame-ignore-revs
#
# Commits listed here are ignored by `git blame` (and by GitHub's web blame,
# which honors this file automatically when it sits at the repo root).
#
# Usage: one full 40-hex commit hash per line, no prefixes. Lines starting
# with `#` are comments and are skipped.
#
# Local enablement (per-developer; cannot be committed):
#   git config blame.ignoreRevsFile .git-blame-ignore-revs
#
# GitHub needs no config: the web blame honors this file automatically.

